 *	Modul:	Serial line interface controller for background communication
 *			supports multiple interface types like 
 *			KL6xxx 3 byte alternative mode
 *			KL6xxx 5 byte standard mode
 *			KL6xxx 22 byte standard mode with extended process data interface
 *			KL6xxx 64 byte PC COM port
 *			EL6xxx 22 byte 
 *			IP6xxx 11 byte
 *			communication between a serial line hardware device and 
 *			PLC communication buffers (RxBuffer, TxBuffer)
